div.p:
The last two concessions are for cables from Santiago de Cuba to Guantanamo Bay,
                    and from Guantanamo to Habana, with the privilege of establishing connections or
                    sub-stations in any or all of the following places:—Baracoa; Nipe or Antilla;
                    Gibara; Nuevitas or Tarafa; Puerto Padre; San Fernando or Moron; Caibarien;
                    Sagua La Grande or Isabela; Cardenas and Matanzas.
